        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Der Freischütz, Il trovatore, Magic Hunter\n- People: Carl Maria von Weber, Friedrich Kind, Giuseppe Verdi, Salvadore Cammarano, Antonio García Gutiérrez, Ildikó Enyedi\n- Topics: opera, film, librettos, adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Der Freischütz, Op. 77, J. 277, is a German opera with spoken dialogue in three acts by Carl Maria von Weber with a libretto by Friedrich Kind.\n- Il trovatore is an opera in four acts by Giuseppe Verdi to an Italian libretto largely written by Salvadore Cammarano and based on Antonio García Gutiérrez's 1836 play El trovador.\n- Magic Hunter is a 1994 Hungarian-Swiss-French fantasy film written and directed by Ildikó Enyedi and loosely inspired by the opera Der Freischütz.",
